<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header', { page: page }) %>

<section class="section" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">About the workshop</div>
    <h2>Two decades of aluminium and glass, made in Pakistan.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">Sohaib Aluminium and Glass Works was founded in 2002 to build a local alternative to imported facade systems — one workshop, precise tolerances, and a habit of showing up on install day.</p>

    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="photo-frame about-photo">
          <img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/8529658/pexels-photo-8529658.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=900" alt="Facade of a modern multistory building with glass windows">
        </div>
        <div class="stat-row">
          <div class="stat"><b>20+</b><span>Years fabricating</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>ISO</b><span>9001:2015 certified</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><b>3</b><span>Client sectors served</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>Sohaib Aluminium and Glass Works was founded in 2002 with a vision to change how aluminium and glass work gets built in Pakistan. What began as a small workshop has grown into a full manufacturing and installation operation, serving commercial, industrial, and residential clients nationwide with custom fabrication and a state-of-the-art facility.</p>
        <p>Every project — from a single sliding door to a thirty-storey curtain wall — runs through the same process: a real consultation, a design built to the site, manufacturing to tolerance, and installation by the people who built it.</p>
        <div class="mv-row">
          <div class="mv-card"><h3>Mission</h3><p>Deliver aluminium and glass solutions that hold up past handover, and exceed what the brief asked for.</p></div>
          <div class="mv-card"><h3>Vision</h3><p>Be the partner architects and builders call first for aluminium and glass work in the region.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="values-row">
      <div class="value-cell"><div class="num">VALUE / 01</div><h3>Quality</h3><p>We don't compromise on materials or finish, on any job, regardless of size.</p></div>
      <div class="value-cell"><div class="num">VALUE / 02</div><h3>Integrity</h3><p>Honest quotes, transparent timelines, and communication you can act on.</p></div>
      <div class="value-cell"><div class="num">VALUE / 03</div><h3>Innovation</h3><p>New profiles, coatings, and glazing techniques, adopted when they earn their place.</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="kicker" style="margin-top:66px;">How a project runs</div>
    <h2 style="font-size:25px;">Consultation to installation, in four stages.</h2>
    <div class="process-row">
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-num">01</div><h3>Consultation</h3><p>We listen to the brief and the site, and give a straight assessment of what it needs.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-num">02</div><h3>Design</h3><p>Our designers draw custom profiles and glazing specs to match the structure and budget.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-num">03</div><h3>Manufacturing</h3><p>Fabricated in-house on precision machinery, checked against spec before it ships.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><div class="step-num">04</div><h3>Installation</h3><p>Our own certified crews install and finish, not a subcontractor we've never met.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ MILESTONES ============ -->
<section class="section alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Milestones</div>
    <h2>Two decades, in stages.</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item"><b>2002</b><h3>Workshop founded</h3><p>Sohaib Aluminium and Glass Works opens in Islamabad with a single fabrication line and a handful of residential clients.</p></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><b>2009</b><h3>Commercial contracts begin</h3><p>First curtain-wall contracts for commercial plazas mark the shift from residential-only work.</p></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><b>2015</b><h3>Facility expansion</h3><p>The workshop moves to a larger, purpose-built facility with upgraded precision machinery.</p></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><b>2020</b><h3>ISO 9001:2015 certified</h3><p>Formal quality management certification, reflecting the tolerances the workshop had already been holding to.</p></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><b>2026</b><h3>Nationwide reach</h3><p>Projects delivered across Islamabad, Rawalpindi, Lahore, and Karachi, with the same in-house crews on every install.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ TEAM ============ -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">The people behind it</div>
    <h2>A small team, hands-on at every stage.</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">No call centre and no subcontracted install crew — the people who quote the job are the ones who build and fit it.</p>
    <div class="team-grid">
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="photo-frame team-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/8961065/pexels-photo-8961065.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=500" alt="Workshop lead reviewing aluminium profiles"></div>
        <h3>Workshop Lead</h3>
        <span class="team-role">Fabrication</span>
      </div>
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="photo-frame team-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/8961064/pexels-photo-8961064.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=500" alt="Design engineer at a drafting table"></div>
        <h3>Design Engineer</h3>
        <span class="team-role">Drawings & specs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="photo-frame team-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/8961066/pexels-photo-8961066.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=500" alt="Site supervisor at an installation site"></div>
        <h3>Site Supervisor</h3>
        <span class="team-role">Installation</span>
      </div>
      <div class="team-card">
        <div class="photo-frame team-photo"><img src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/8961067/pexels-photo-8961067.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=500" alt="Client relations manager on a call"></div>
        <h3>Client Relations</h3>
        <span class="team-role">Quotes & scheduling</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<!-- ============ CERTIFICATIONS & PARTNERS ============ -->
<section class="section alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kicker">Certifications & partners</div>
    <h2>Held to a standard, not just a promise.</h2>
    <div class="badge-row">
      <div class="partner-badge">ISO 9001:2015</div>
      <div class="partner-badge">EST. 2002</div>
      <div class="partner-badge">Powder-coat certified applicators</div>
      <div class="partner-badge">Tempered glass safety compliant</div>
      <div class="partner-badge">Member — Pakistan Aluminium Fabricators Assoc.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<%- include('partials/fab') %>

<script src="/js/script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
